# add the public key in github 
Navigat to  - account settting > ssh and gpg key  crate new file 
	Title : "Allow Abhiram Laptop to acc github"
	key type : Authentication Key 
	key : [paste here the copied content in previous step ]
	
# update the exising ssh config file 
notepad ~/.ssh/config 

# add the below content in last 
	------------------
	# ABHIRAM197504 github account 
	Host github.com-abhiram197504
		HostName github.com
		User git 
		IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_github_abhiram197504
	
# test your ssh connection 
ssh -T git@github.com-abhiram197504
Hi abhiram197504! You've successfully authenticated, but GitHub does not provide shell access.


